[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4141.99, "timestamp": "01:09:01", "text": "親切です。 彼らは長老たちだ。   えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4144.95, "timestamp": "01:09:04", "text": "彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.349, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "仕事のやり方とか色々教えてくれて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4152.03, "timestamp": "01:09:12", "text": "本当に親切なんです。  [音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.309, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "いつも、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4159.47, "timestamp": "01:09:19", "text": "ええと、私の場合は、私がしている"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4165.312, "timestamp": "01:09:25", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm mhm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4167.11, "timestamp": "01:09:27", "text": "仕事のオーナー、つまり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4170.269, "timestamp": "01:09:30", "text": "CEOに実際に会う機会がなかったんです。彼は病気だったので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4173.67, "timestamp": "01:09:33", "text": "別のスタッフ、アシスタントが私の面接を受け、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4178.309, "timestamp": "01:09:38", "text": "その後彼に会うことができました。あまり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4181.23, "timestamp": "01:09:41", "text": "話はしませんでしたが、ええと、私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4183.95, "timestamp": "01:09:43", "text": "仕事はすべて、この"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4186.87, "timestamp": "01:09:46", "text": "マネージャー、つまり、そこに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4189.63, "timestamp": "01:09:49", "text": "長くいる従業員が担当してくれています。ええと、ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4195.99, "timestamp": "01:09:55", "text": "彼はとても親切で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4197.35, "timestamp": "01:09:57", "text": "協力的で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4199.31, "timestamp": "01:09:59", "text": "特に、"}]